  *
- * False — and `fence_out` untouched — for anything else: a sync with no
+ * Returns how many were written to `fences_out`, at most `max_fences`.
+ * ZERO — and `fences_out` untouched — for anything else: a sync with no
  * fence yet, one already signalled, one pending on `chan` itself (the
